  "question": {
    "text": "For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>, let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then the minimum value of the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math> defined by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></msup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2023</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math> is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "0",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></msup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2023</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Now differentiating both side we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></msup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2023</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>&#160;where&#160;</mtext><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></msup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2023</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8704;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8197;&#8197;&#8197;&#8197;</mo></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>which&#160;is</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext>&#160;for&#160;</mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8197;&#8197;&#8197;&#8197;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8197;&#8197;&#8197;&#8197;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> has minimum at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>And <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
